  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "30MMシリーズバイロン軍より新機体「シエルノヴァ」が登場！ポルタノヴァとの連動でカスタマイズの幅がより広がる！",
      "en": "A new aircraft \"Ciel Nova\" is now available from the 30MM series Byron Army! The range of customization is expanded by linking with Portanova!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• マッシヴな脚部、長い前腕、上方向に拡張できるバックパックなど、特徴的なパーツ構成。",
      "en": "• Distinctive parts configuration including massive legs, long forearms, and a backpack that can expand upwards."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 拡張可能な関節機構を採用。新規の股関節パーツを既存の機体に組み込み、体型のアレンジが可能。",
      "en": "• Adopts expandable joint mechanism. The new hip joint parts can be incorporated into the existing fuselage to rearrange the body shape."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 指揮官機用、特殊部隊用、近接格闘用の胸部パーツはポルタノヴァと連動。",
      "en": "• Chest parts for commander aircraft, special forces, and close combat are linked with Portanova."
    }
  ],
